---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="数据保密政策 – Eternal CNC"
  description="了解 Eternal CNC 如何通过严格的保密措施保护您的技术图纸、规格参数和知识产权。"
>
  <!-- 面包屑 -->
  <section class="bg-gray-50 py-4 border-b border-gray-200">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <nav class="text-sm text-gray-500">
        <a href="/zh" class="transition-all duration-300 hover:text-[#8B0000]">首页</a>
        <span class="mx-2">/</span>
        <span class="text-gray-700">保密政策</span>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 标题区 -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-gray-900 text-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4">
        数据<span class="text-[#8B0000]">保密</span>政策
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-300 max-w-2xl">
        您的设计就是您的竞争优势，保护它们是我们的义务。
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 我们保护的内容 (2x2 卡片) -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-gray-50">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">我们保护的内容</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 mb-10">您提交给 Eternal CNC 的所有内容均受严格保密义务保护。</p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-8 border border-gray-200 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-[#8B0000]/30">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-[#8B0000] text-white flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-4">📐</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">技术图纸</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">CAD 文件、STEP、IGES、DWG 及所有专有设计文档。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-8 border border-gray-200 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-[#8B0000]/30">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-[#8B0000] text-white flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-4">📋</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">材料规格</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">合金牌号、热处理要求和表面光洁度标准。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-8 border border-gray-200 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-[#8B0000]/30">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-[#8B0000] text-white flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-4">📊</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">数量与定价</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">报价明细、批量数量和商业条款。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-8 border border-gray-200 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-[#8B0000]/30">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-[#8B0000] text-white flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-4">🔧</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">定制工装</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">为您的项目专门设计的夹具、治具和专用刀具。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 我们如何保护 (2x2 卡片) -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">我们如何保护</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 mb-10">企业级安全措施，守护您的知识产权。</p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-8 border border-gray-200 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-[#8B0000]/30">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-[#8B0000] text-white flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-4">🔒</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">加密存储</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">所有项目文件均存储在 AES-256 加密云存储中，并配有访问日志。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-8 border border-gray-200 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-[#8B0000]/30">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-[#8B0000] text-white flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-4">📝</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">员工保密协议</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">每位员工在获得访问权限前均需签署全面的保密协议。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-8 border border-gray-200 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-[#8B0000]/30">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-[#8B0000] text-white flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-4">🗑️</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">数据保留与删除</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">可根据您的要求或在项目完成后按要求永久删除文件。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-8 border border-gray-200 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-[#8B0000]/30">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-[#8B0000] text-white flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-4">📄</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">NDA 支持</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">我们可以签署您的标准 NDA，或提供我们的模板。联系我们即可启动。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 深色 CTA -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-gray-900 text-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">对数据安全有疑问？</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-300 mb-8">我们对保密实践完全透明。联系我们，工程团队将在 24 小时内回复。</p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
        <a href="/zh/contact" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#8B0000] text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-md font-medium transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-[#6B0000] hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-0.5">
          联系我们 →
        </a>
        <a href="mailto:sales@eternalcnc.com" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 border-2 border-white text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-md font-medium transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-white hover:text-gray-900 hover:shadow-md hover:-translate-y-0.5">
          sales@eternalcnc.com
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>